          "row": 7,
          "col": 1,
          "html": "Checks for updates for all lists, if updates are found, the list is updated, removing or adding entries as needed, the lists are not redownloaded in full when issuing a reload, instead only necessary updates are done. <br/><br/><strong>Important:</strong> It's not mandatory to use reload to update the lists, Adlist checks for new updates once every four hours. <br/><br/>"
        }
